comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T18:18:19.318Z","harness:codex","Implementation start: active in the cohesive automatic identity platform PR spanning the identity ADR, structured SDK provenance, precedence-safe observation, declarative harness registry, MCP/plugin configuration, and token-minimal help guidance. Duplicate check covered all 2,028 tracker items and live GitHub reports; no new item created."
  "2026-07-25T19:14:51.252Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: SDK now exports structured agent/model provenance types, pure detection, invocation signal scoping, workspace descriptor scoping, history provenance lookup, and collision-safe package registration. MCP initialization contributes bounded client name/version/model/session signals. Packed isolated consumer proved the public SDK configures a custom harness and the installed CLI persists model provenance without PM_AUTHOR. Full 6,376-test suite and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage passed."
  "2026-07-25T19:26:50.893Z","harness:codex","Release-gate evidence: repository-owned release pipeline passed type tests, docs/skills, strict static/docstring/token/API gates, exact 100% coverage, version policy, version sync, secret scan, packed npx smoke, and 88-command package-first dogfood. The only pre-push failure is hosted-analysis-gate because DeepScan cannot have an exact-commit status for the current uncommitted main-derived SHA; this gate will be rerun against the pushed PR head."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T12:41:50.313Z","harness:claude-code","Treating an observation as a fallback is a design error that keeps recurring in identity code. resolveAuthorIdentity returns early as soon as a higher-precedence branch supplies an author, so detected harness — and soon the detected model — is computed only when nothing else answered. Precedence over WHICH value is authoritative is a separate question from whether an observation is worth recording: the assertion decides the author, the observation decides the provenance, and both belong in the entry. The general rule for any future precedence chain in this codebase: resolve the authoritative value by precedence, but record every cheap observation unconditionally, and keep a discriminator saying which is which."
